        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I feel no regret."
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   No, what I mean is...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "No, what I mean is..."
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I will always use my power for your sake. No matter what kind of burden he was carrying, I don't regret killing him.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I will always use my power for your sake. No matter what kind of burden he was carrying, I don't regret killing him."
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   But... there should have been a better way.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "But... there should have been a better way."
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   He died because... I wasn't able to find it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "He died because... I wasn't able to find it."
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   And that... is eating me up inside.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "And that... is eating me up inside."
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I don't want...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I don't want..."
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I don't want you to see this side of me, {@nickname}.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I don't want you to see this side of me, {@nickname}."
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Even though I've always talked about freeing the Infected from pain and suffering...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Even though I've always talked about freeing the Infected from pain and suffering..."
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   But when matters the most, I have to persuade myself, again and again, that it's justified to take the life of another Infected.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "But when matters the most, I have to persuade myself, again and again, that it's justified to take the life of another Infected."
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I am truly pathetic.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I am truly pathetic."
